  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BAIR - Bitola&apos;s joint Action for the Inclusion of Roma</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overall objective (Impact): To foster the socio-economic inclusion of the Roma Communities living in Bitola  North Macedonia Specific objective (Outcome) 1: To increase the capacities and opportunities of the target Roma community to integrate into Bitolas social community [COMMUNITY STRENGTHENING] Specific objective (Outcome) 2: To improve the living conditions of the target Roma community in the upgraded settlements of Bitola [URBAN UPGRADING] Specific objective (Outcome) 3: To increase the access to health, socio-educational, employment services for the target Roma community in Bitola [SOCIAL RIGHTS]&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
